# Web Application (Offline Capable)

An interactive and lightweight web application equipped with offline caching and PWA (Progressive Web App) support.

## 🚀 Features

- **Offline Ready:** Runs smoothly without an active internet connection using Service Workers.
- **PWA Support:** Installable on mobile and desktop directly from the browser.
- **Fast Performance:** Critical assets are cached locally for near-instant load times.
- **Responsive Layout:** Optimized for both mobile and desktop screens.

## 📂 Project Structure

```text
├── index.html         # Main application interface
├── manifest.json      # PWA configuration metadata
├── sw.js              # Service worker for offline asset caching
├── icons/             # App icons (192x192, 512x512)
│   ├── icon-192.png
│   └── icon-512.png
└── README.md          # Documentation
